Subject: rpcd: reject ambiguous or incomplete checked recovery journals

Keep version-1 writer compatibility, but validate every field exactly once.
Read the complete bounded regular file, retry interrupted reads, and retain
malformed evidence while blocking writes. This is not a durable recovery
or power-loss guarantee; checked support remains disabled by default.

---

